    <string name="reliability_oem_body">Xiaomi: Settings, Apps, Adhan, Battery saver, No restrictions. Pin the app in Recents.\nHuawei: Settings, Battery, App launch, Adhan, Manage manually, and turn the switches on.\nSamsung: Settings, Battery, Background usage limits, Never sleeping apps, add Adhan. If install says the app was blocked, turn Auto Blocker off, install, then you can turn it on again.\nOppo and Realme: Settings, Battery, Adhan, allow background activity and auto launch.</string>
